ntified  The first specimen is submitted in cassettes C and D and the second fragment in E H  Labeled  right breast  re excision lateral margin  are three fragments of breast tissue  The first fragment is oriented by a short suture designating superior  and measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm  The aspect opposite to the suture is rough with punctate hemorrhage  The aspect with the suture is inked black and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal no tumor or nodule grossly identified  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes I L  The second fragment is oriented by a long suture  designating lateral  and measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  The aspect opposite to the suture is rough with punctate hemorrhage  The aspect with the suture is inked blue and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal no nodule or tumor grossly identified  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes M O  The third fragment is REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm fibroadipose tissue with a REMOVED_DATE x 0 1cm skin ellipse  Cross sectioning the specimen reveals hemorrhage and fat necrosis  however  no tumor or nodule is grossly identified  The specimen is entirely submitted in P and Q  Resident  Mari Mino  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1 2  LYMPH NODE  RT AXILLARY SENTINEL NODES   EXCISION  THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  O R  Resident  HEIKE VARNHOLT  MD O R  Diagnosis by  GREGORY LAUWERS  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Frederick William Ackroyd  M D  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT MEDIAL MARGIN   RE EXCISION PART B  BREAST  RIGHT LATERAL MARGIN   RE EXCISION PART C  LYMPH NODE  RIGHT AXILLARY SENTINEL   EXCISION , Unchecked.
