jacent to the tip of the localization wire  The specimen is entirely submitted from anterior to posterior as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   with the anterior margin en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   the posterior margin en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   the cavity is  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   and the tissue adjacent to the tip of the localization wire as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   with the tissue containing the silver metal clip as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN and  left modified radical mastectomy   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 5 5cm modified radical mastectomy specimen with attached axillary tail measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 5cm  There an overlying elliptical portion of tan  wrinkled  hair bearing skin measuring REMOVED_DATE x 14 5cm  with a tan  wrinkled areola that measures 4 0cm in diameter and a pink brown  slightly flattened nipple measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm  There is a C shaped  slightly puckered area at the periphery of the areola measuring 3 0cm in length  The specimen is inked for orientation as follows  Anterior   blue  posterior   black  Sectioning reveals three firm  stellate  ill defined masses in the central to lower inner quadrant measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm  and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm  and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE  from lateral to medial   These areas are located 2 5cm from the posterior margin and 7 5cm from the anterior margin  7 5cm from the posterior margin and 3 0cm from the anterior margin  and 5 0cm from the posterior margin and 2 0cm from the anterior margin respectively  From lateral to medial  these areas are 3 2cm and 5 0cm from one another  There is a marked amount of nodular fibrous tissue at the periphery of these firm areas  The remaining cut surfaces consists predominantly of yellow  lobulated adipose tissue with a small amount of interspersed gray white fibrous tissue  The axillary tail is dissected and 