s by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  29 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 09 14 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number only is a 3 x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm fragment of dense breast with an ill defined REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm firm nodule  within 0 2cm of the closest inked surface  Submitted entirely in cassettes A through H with nodule in A and B  Resident  MARYAM S  MOHAMMADKHANI  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  SUSPICIOUS LESION TOO SMALL TO FREEZE  O R  Resident  Timothy R  Quinn  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT  BIOPSY    report_end  , Unchecked.
