CRIPTION   Received are 4 containers which are  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN     Received fresh  labeled  right breast   is an 18 x 15 x 4 0cm mastectomy  specimen  with 2 sutures  A short suture designating superior aspect of the  specimen  a long suture designating the lateral aspect of the specimen  The  overlying REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm  tan white ellipse of skin appears unremarkable  The  nipple and the areola appear unremarkable  The anterior margin is inked blue   and the posterior margin is inked black  The specimen is serially sectioned to  reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  tan pink  firm  irregular mass  mass  1   with  central puckering  located in the upper outer quadrant  A surgical clip is  found within the lesion  The mass is located 1 0cm from the closest posterior  margin and 0 6cm from the closest blue inked anterior margin  Approximately  1 5cm superior to the aforementioned mass  in the upper outer quadrant  there  is a separate irregular firm nodular mass  mass  2  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE  cm with a surgical clip within it  The mass is located 1 0cm from the closest  anterior margin and 1 0cm from the closest posterior margin  Approximately 3  cm inferior to mass  1  there is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm region of tan white   firm  fibrous tissue  with a gritty texture that measures 0 5cm from the  closest blue inked anterior margin and 0 3cm from the black inked posterior  margin  The lesion is located at the junction of the upper outer and lower  outer quadrants and extends into the lower outer quadrant  No axillary lymph  nodes are identified in the specimen  The specimen is submitted as follows      REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  1 to closest anterior margin    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass  1 to closest posterior margin    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional section of mass  1 to posterior margin    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Additional mass  1 to anterior margin    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Rep