tibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  13 REMOVED_MONTH 96 at 11 55 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Right breast tissue  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm fragment of breast tissue which is inked and sectioned to reveal a 1 4cm firm stellate mass abutting the inked margin  The remaining tissue is unremarkable  Representative sections of the mass are submitted in cassettes A through C  Representative sections of the remainder of the tissue is submitted in cassettes D through F  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC Resident  HOWARD CHANG  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  BREAST  RIGHT   INVASIVE CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  Joseph Misdraji  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Susan E Briggs  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
