ained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  17 MAY 96 at 14 43 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm piece of breast tissue  The specimen is inked and sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 7cm firm fibrofatty and focally white mass grossly abutting the inked margins  Representative sections of the mass are frozen as frozen section  1  and saved frozen  Representative sections of the mass are submitted in cassettes in A through E  normal breast in F  Resident  Eugene F  Ruffolo  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FXDX  1  BREAST  LEFT   BIOPSY  INFILTRATING DUCTAL CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  STEPHEN LAU  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Max L  Goodman  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT    report_end  , Unchecked.
